    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<h2>Leyline Attunement</h2><p><em>You don’t just cross the world. You listen to it.</em></p><hr /><h3>Rules</h3><p>When you take a Respite, you may attune to the local flow. Until your next Sanctuary, you gain one of the following benefits (choose when you attune):</p><ul><li><strong>Guidance of the Current:</strong> You reroll the lowest die on one Athletics (Violence) checks you make each hour of travel.</li><li><strong>Quiet Step:</strong> You reroll the lowest die on one Stealth (Intrigue) checks you make each hour of travel.</li><li><strong>Resonant Warning:</strong> You reroll the lowest die on Initiative (Intrigue) rolls made in the first combat after you begin travel.</li></ul><p>You can change the chosen benefit each time you attune.</p>",
